---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Officer Team - FBLA Chapter" description="Meet our dedicated FBLA chapter officers and leadership team">
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Officer Team</h1>
			<p>Meet the dedicated leaders of Irvington FBLA</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="officers">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="officers-grid">
				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/veer (2).jpg" alt="President" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Veer Mistry</h3>
						<h4>President</h4>
						<p>As FBLA President, I oversee the officer team and chapter operations, competing in events like SEM while balancing my passion for hiking, basketball, and research.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/naina.jpg" alt="Vice President of Logistics" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Naina Akkati</h3>
						<h4>Vice President of Logistics</h4>
						<p>Hi! I'm a junior at Irvington High School. I serve as the Vice President of Logistics for FBLA, where I help manage the club's finances, organize events, and have competed in events such as Intro to Business Communications. Outside of FBLA, I love to travel and am passionate about dance, which has been a big part of my life and a way for me to express creativity.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/poojha.JPG" alt="Director of Logistics" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Poojha Suresh Kumar</h3>
						<h4>Director of Logistics</h4>
						<p>I am the Director of Logistics for FBLA, and I help with the club's logistics for events and conferences. Some events that I have competed in through FBLA in the past include Intro to Event Planning and UX Design.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/stefanie.JPG" alt="Vice President of Competitions" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Stefanie Da Cruz</h3>
						<h4>Vice President of Competitions</h4>
						<p>Stefanie oversees our competitive programs and coordinates preparation for state and national competitions.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/krish.jpg" alt="Director of Competitions" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Krish Kowkuntla</h3>
						<h4>Director of Competitions</h4>
						<p>As Director of Competitions, I help coordinate meetings and competitions while competing in events like Business Communications and Business Management. Some of my hobbies are playing basketball, reading, and watching football.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/tanvi.jpg" alt="Director of Competitions" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Tanvi Sardana</h3>
						<h4>Director of Competitions</h4>
						<p>Hi! I'm one of the directors of competitions this year! This is my second year in FBLA and in my free time, I love traveling, competing in speech & debate, trying new food, and volunteering!</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/eva.JPG" alt="Director of Comps" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Eva Arya</h3>
						<h4>Director of Comps</h4>
						<p>As a Director of Competitions in FBLA, I help run club meetings and help members achieve national success! In my free time, I like to play tennis and research.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/vaishnavi.jpg" alt="Vice President of Outreach" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Vaishnavi Polavarapu</h3>
						<h4>Vice President of Outreach</h4>
						<p>Hi! My name is Vaishnavi, and I'm excited to serve as your Vice President of Outreach this year. This is my third year in FBLA, and it's been an amazing opportunity to pursue my passion for business while exploring different areas of the field.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/pleasework.png" alt="Director of External Outreach" class="avnita-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Avnita</h3>
						<h4>Director of External Outreach</h4>
						<p>Hi! My name is Avnita, and I'm excited to be serving as one of the Directors of Outreach this year! This is my second year in FBLA, and outside of FBLA I enjoy traveling, creating art, trying new foods, and volunteering. My favorite events are in marketing, and I'm really looking forward to the 25-26 season!</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/rahul.jpg" alt="Director of Internal Outreach" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Rahul M. Rajkumar</h3>
						<h4>Director of Internal Outreach</h4>
						<p>Rahul focuses on internal member engagement and fostering connections within our chapter community.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/advika.jpg" alt="Vice President of Programs" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Advika Anand</h3>
						<h4>Vice President of Programs</h4>
						<p>Advika oversees our chapter programs and coordinates educational and professional development activities.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/neel.jpg" alt="Director of Programs" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Neel Bhimani</h3>
						<h4>Director of Programs</h4>
						<p>Neel manages program implementation and ensures quality delivery of chapter educational initiatives.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/harshith.jpg" alt="Director of Programs" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Harshith Sai</h3>
						<h4>Director of Programs</h4>
						<p>Harshith supports program development and coordinates member participation in chapter activities.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="officer-card">
					<div class="officer-image">
						<img src="/team/aratrika.jpg" alt="Intern" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="officer-info">
						<h3>Aratrika Pal</h3>
						<h4>Intern</h4>
						<p>I'm a logistics intern for FBLA, and help to create and fill out forms for the club. I placed in Intro to IT last year.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="advisor">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Chapter Advisor</h2>
			<div class="advisor-card">
				<div class="advisor-image">
					<img src="/team/advisor.jpg" alt="Chapter Advisor" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				</div>
				<div class="advisor-info">
					<h3>Mr. Albizo</h3>
					<h4>Business Education Teacher & FBLA Advisor</h4>
					<p>Mr. Albizo has been our dedicated FBLA advisor for 8 years. He brings extensive business experience and passion for developing future leaders. Under his guidance, our chapter has achieved numerous state and national recognitions.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 3rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	.officers {
		padding: 4rem 0;
	}

	.officers-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.officer-card {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
	}

	.officer-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
	}

	.officer-image {
		height: 250px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.officer-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.avnita-image {
		transform: scale(1.02);
	}

	.officer-info {
		padding: 1.5rem;
	}

	.officer-info h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.officer-info h4 {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: #3b82f6;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.officer-info p {
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}

	.officer-contact a {
		color: #3b82f6;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.officer-contact a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.advisor {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		background: #f8fafc;
	}

	.advisor h2 {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
	}

	.advisor-card {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		background: white;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
		overflow: hidden;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.advisor-image {
		height: 300px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.advisor-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.advisor-info {
		padding: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.advisor-info h3 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.advisor-info h4 {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: #3b82f6;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.advisor-info p {
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}

	.advisor-contact {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.advisor-contact a {
		color: #3b82f6;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.advisor-contact a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.advisor-contact span {
		color: #6b7280;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.officers-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.advisor-card {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			text-align: center;
		}

		.advisor-image {
			height: 250px;
		}
	}
</style>
